Clear a scoped default signature

Usage: mxr signatures clear-default [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --kind <KIND>        Which compose kind to clear [default: all] [possible values: all, new, reply]
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Account selector (key, name, email, or id). Omit for global default
      --from <FROM_EMAIL>  Exact from-address default within the account
  -h, --help               Print help
